    "turn_text": "Well, I am glad to say that this is an idea that enjoys a lot of support in our delegation. And in fact, I'm very proud of the fact that that support is bipartisan. One thing that you will find in people who are from our area is that we all know and love Florida Strawberry Festival. So this piece of legislation was about as popular, I think, as they can be.",
