        "text": "The audience recognizes the significance of holding a post-election hearing on the 2022 midterms.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s prior role as Secretary of State of Florida lends credibility to their insights on election issues.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Audience members expect the speaker to provide actionable or meaningful takeaways from the hearing.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Publicly discussing election outcomes and lessons learned is considered appropriate and valuable political discourse.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker's leadership role in the subcommittee implies expertise and responsibility in electoral matters.",
