    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84195.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "Yes, that's exactly right. So we will have a series of hearings throughout this Congress and I know we'll have some hearings that are related to those issues I just mentioned that we want to be sure that we're working hard on cybersecurity and infrastructure and being the resource that states may need in that regard, we'll also be taking a look at states that have had struggles. You know, there are places where they've had a hard time administering their elections or some challenges that they need to overcome. We'll be taking a look there too. One of our large-scale objectives is really transparency. It is so important that the public has confidence in the integrity of our elections And your transparency is such an important part of that. We want the public to have good, clear, accurate information about elections. I know in Florida, I always believe that the more the public knew, the more confident they would be",
